# Symbol store root for release operations.
#
# Required to exist by scripts/validate-release-operations.ps1 (symbolPolicy.storePath
# = "release/symbols"), which throws if this directory is missing — that check runs
# before the build in .github/workflows/lucid-build.yml, so without this placeholder
# every CI run fails on a fresh checkout before compiling.
#
# Actual symbol artifacts produced during a release stay untracked (see .gitignore).
